    <item>
      <title>Product Craft</title>
      <link>https://appapappa.com/teaching/product_craft/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 May 2025 10:51:41 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://appapappa.com/teaching/product_craft/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A few months ago a close friend asked if I could run a Product Craft 101 workshop at her company. They wanted to coach people who were in traditional client program management roles (in an Enterprise SaaS context) to move towards product innovation. I enjoyed running the workshop - building new products is fun &amp;amp; I was able to share my excitement for the craft of building products with the participants!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
